      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "ZedW",
        "name": "影奥义！分身",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "<font color='#FF9900'>被动：</font>当劫和他的影分身用相同技能击中一名敌方英雄时，劫会回复能量。每次施放技能只会回复一次能量。<br><br><font color='#FF9900'>主动：</font>劫的影分身向前突进，并在一个地方维持若干秒。再次激活此技能会让劫与这个影分身互换位置。",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">被动：</span>当劫和他的<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">影分身</span>用相同技能击中一名敌方英雄时，劫会回复<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">30/35/40/45/50能量</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">主动：</span>劫的<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">影分身</span>向前冲刺，并在一个地方维持5秒。<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">再次施放</span>这个技能会让劫与这个<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">影分身</span>互换位置。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">每次施放技能只会回复一次<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">能量</span>。</span>",
